        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right elbow pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent, persisting outer right elbow pain for approximately 9–10/12, worse over the last 2–3/12. Described as a local ache with sharp pain on lifting or gripping. Worse with scanning groceries, lifting bags, pouring a kettle, and gripping a steering wheel, especially with the forearm pronated. Improved with rest. Pain reported as approximately 9–10/12."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
